  "prefLabel": "Phy 103.05 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 103.05 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public. Pursuant to RSA 91-A:2, II, members of the public may attend and record board meetings, except for those parts of the meetings which are nonpublic sessions as defined in 91-A:3.\n\nSource. #9039, eff 11-26-05; ss by #12993, eff 2-22-20 (formerly Phy 103.06) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25",
